{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2019-10-30 22:30:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ANNOUNCES CONSTRUCTION IS UNDERWAY ON EXPANSION PROJECT FOR THE CARRIERS LEADERSHIP AND AIRCREW DEVELOPMENT/LEAD CENTER ON ITS HEADQUARTERS CAMPUS', 'text': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ANNOUNCED CONSTRUCTION IS UNDERWAY ON AN EXPANSION PROJECT FOR THE CARRIERS LEADERSHIP AND AIRCREW DEVELOPMENT/LEAD CENTER ON ITS HEADQUARTERS CAMPUS. IT IS ANTICIPATED TO OPEN IN FALL 2020. THE THREE-STORY 141,000-SQUARE-FOOT EXPANSION PROJECT WILL ADD SPACE FOR EIGHT ADDITIONAL FLIGHT SIMULATORS, UP FROM ITS CURRENT 18 SIMULATORS, ADDITIONAL BRIEFING ROOMS AND SPACE FOR SMALLER FLIGHT TRAINING DEVICES. BETWEEN CONTINUING QUALIFICATION TRAINING, CAPTAIN UPGRADE CLASSES AND NEW HIRE CLASSES, THE CARRIER TRAINS AN AVERAGE OF 850 PILOTS MONTHLY AT THE LEAD CENTER. THIS EXPANSION ALLOWS TO PLAN FOR THE FUTURE WHILE CONTINUING COMMITMENT TO PROVIDE THE INDUSTRYS BEST TRAINING TO GROWING PILOT WORKFORCE, SAID ALAN KASHER, SOUTHWESTS VICE PRESIDENT OF FLIGHT OPERATIONS. THIS INVESTMENT PAVES THE WAY TO ALLOW FOR TRAINING OF MORE PILOTS AT ANY GIVEN TIME AS WELL AS PREPARES SOUTHWEST FOR FUTURE PILOT GROWTH. THE EXPANSION PROJECT IS BEING LED BY MCCARTHY BUILDING COMPANIES WHICH WILL SERVE AS CONSTRUCTION MANAGER AT RISK. THE COMPANY RECENTLY COMPLETED CONSTRUCTION OF THE ORIGINAL LEAD CENTER WHICH INCLUDES AN OFFICE BUILDING HOUSING THE AIRLINES OPERATIONAL TEAMS AND A PARKING GARAGE. THE MCCARTHY TEAMS FACED UNIQUE CHALLENGES WHILE BUILDING THE TRAINING CENTER AT SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CAMPUS HEADQUARTERS.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2019-10-30 11:30:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES EXTENDS FLIGHT SCHEDULE THROUGH JUNE 6, 2020, WITH NONSTOP SERVICE TO LINK HAWAII AND SAN DIEGO NOW ON-SALE, PURCHASE TODAY ONE-WAY FOR AS LOW AS $129', 'text': 'PRESS RELEASE - SOUTHWEST AIRLINES EXTENDS FLIGHT SCHEDULE THROUGH JUNE 6, 2020, WITH NONSTOP SERVICE TO LINK HAWAII AND SAN DIEGO NOW ON-SALE, PURCHASE TODAY ONE-WAY FOR AS LOW AS $129.SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO - ONCE DAILY SERVICE BETWEEN SAN DIEGO AND KAHULUI ON MAUI BEGINS APRIL 14, 2020.SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO - ONCE DAILY SERVICE BETWEEN SAN DIEGO AND HONOLULU ON OAHU BEGINS APRIL 20, 2020.SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO - BEGINNING APRIL 14, 2020, CO WILL OFFER 6 FLIGHTS DAILY IN EACH DIRECTION ON INTERISLAND SERVICE BETWEEN HONOLULU AND KAHULUI.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2019-10-30 22:30:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ANNOUNCES CONSTRUCTION IS UNDERWAY ON EXPANSION PROJECT FOR THE CARRIERS LEADERSHIP AND AIRCREW DEVELOPMENT/LEAD CENTER ON ITS HEADQUARTERS CAMPUS', 'text': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ANNOUNCED CONSTRUCTION IS UNDERWAY ON AN EXPANSION PROJECT FOR THE CARRIERS LEADERSHIP AND AIRCREW DEVELOPMENT/LEAD CENTER ON ITS HEADQUARTERS CAMPUS. IT IS ANTICIPATED TO OPEN IN FALL 2020. THE THREE-STORY 141,000-SQUARE-FOOT EXPANSION PROJECT WILL ADD SPACE FOR EIGHT ADDITIONAL FLIGHT SIMULATORS, UP FROM ITS CURRENT 18 SIMULATORS, ADDITIONAL BRIEFING ROOMS AND SPACE FOR SMALLER FLIGHT TRAINING DEVICES. BETWEEN CONTINUING QUALIFICATION TRAINING, CAPTAIN UPGRADE CLASSES AND NEW HIRE CLASSES, THE CARRIER TRAINS AN AVERAGE OF 850 PILOTS MONTHLY AT THE LEAD CENTER. THIS EXPANSION ALLOWS TO PLAN FOR THE FUTURE WHILE CONTINUING COMMITMENT TO PROVIDE THE INDUSTRYS BEST TRAINING TO GROWING PILOT WORKFORCE, SAID ALAN KASHER, SOUTHWESTS VICE PRESIDENT OF FLIGHT OPERATIONS. THIS INVESTMENT PAVES THE WAY TO ALLOW FOR TRAINING OF MORE PILOTS AT ANY GIVEN TIME AS WELL AS PREPARES SOUTHWEST FOR FUTURE PILOT GROWTH. THE EXPANSION PROJECT IS BEING LED BY MCCARTHY BUILDING COMPANIES WHICH WILL SERVE AS CONSTRUCTION MANAGER AT RISK. THE COMPANY RECENTLY COMPLETED CONSTRUCTION OF THE ORIGINAL LEAD CENTER WHICH INCLUDES AN OFFICE BUILDING HOUSING THE AIRLINES OPERATIONAL TEAMS AND A PARKING GARAGE. THE MCCARTHY TEAMS FACED UNIQUE CHALLENGES WHILE BUILDING THE TRAINING CENTER AT SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CAMPUS HEADQUARTERS.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2019-10-30 11:30:00', 